  "notes": "Written 22 September 2026 for the Station Tap. Chorus-first picks: every one lands on its own within a few seconds to a half-listening room. Checked against every other pack in bingo/ — nothing here is a repeat except Wild, which is also in MBC 5 and was asked for by name. Split from MBC 6 on 1 October 2026 into two ~20-song games for a 3×3 card: every other song, so each half spans the whole pack and no artist is in a half twice. Its other half is MBC 16. Renumbered 8 October 2026 from MBC 6b to MBC 17: every twenty-song game has its own number, clear of the MBC 7, 8 and 9 playlists already in Spotify. The id stays mbc-6b, so the pubs that have heard it still know.",
